msgid ""
msgstr "If you are migrating from a GPU environment, please note the following:"

msgid "GPU Triton算子迁移"
msgstr "GPU Triton Operator Migration"

msgid "概述：本文介绍 GPU Triton 算子迁移到昇腾 NPU 时的通用处理思路和常见问题。迁移时建议先完成 Python 侧设备与运行时接口替换，再检查 grid 分核、访存对齐、单核计算、UB 空间和 coreDim 限制，最后结合具体示例完成代码修改和正确性验证。"
msgstr "Overview: This document introduces the general processing approach and common issues when migrating GPU Triton operators to the Ascend NPU. During migration, it is recommended to first complete the replacement of device and runtime interfaces on the Python side, then check grid partitioning, memory access alignment, single-core computation, UB space, and coreDim constraints, and finally perform code modifications and correctness verification based on specific examples."

msgid "通用迁移流程"
msgstr "General Migration Process"

msgid "迁移 Python 侧设备和运行时接口"
msgstr "Migrate Python-side device and runtime interfaces"

msgid "在修改具体 Triton kernel 前，先完成 Python 侧设备迁移："
msgstr "Before modifying the specific Triton kernel, first complete the device migration on the Python side."

msgid "在 Python 文件中增加 `import torch_npu`。"
msgstr "Add `import torch_npu` in the Python file."

msgid "查找 `device=\"cuda\"`、`device='cuda'`、`.cuda()` 和 `.to(\"cuda\")` 等设备指定方式，改为 `device=\"npu\"`、`device='npu'`、`.npu()` 或 `.to(\"npu\")`。"
msgstr "Search for device specifications such as `device=\"cuda\"`, `device='cuda'`, `.cuda()`, and `.to(\"cuda\")`, and change them to `device=\"npu\"`, `device='npu'`, `.npu()`, or `.to(\"npu\")`."

msgid "查找 `torch.cuda.*`、CUDA stream、CUDA event、CUDA synchronize 等 GPU 专属接口，改为 NPU 对应接口或删除不必要的同步逻辑。"
msgstr "Find `torch.cuda.*`, CUDA stream, CUDA event, CUDA synchronize, and other GPU-specific interfaces, and replace them with corresponding NPU interfaces or remove unnecessary synchronization logic."

msgid "删除只为 GPU 设备发现服务的逻辑，例如 `triton.runtime.driver.active.get_active_torch_device()` 相关设备断言。"
msgstr "Remove the logic that only serves GPU device discovery, such as device assertions related to `triton.runtime.driver.active.get_active_torch_device()`."

msgid "保持 Triton kernel 主体逻辑不变，先用 NPU Tensor 完成编译和正确性验证。"
msgstr "Keep the main logic of the Triton kernel unchanged, first use NPU Tensor to complete compilation and correctness verification."

msgid "调整 grid 分核"
msgstr "Adjust grid partitioning"

msgid "GPU 上常见的写法会把 grid 设计为大量逻辑 program，由硬件和运行时调度到 SM 上执行。迁移到 NPU 时，应优先考虑物理 AI Core 数量和算子类型："
msgstr "Common practice on GPUs involves designing the grid as a large number of logical programs, which are scheduled by hardware and runtime to execute on SMs. When migrating to NPUs, priority should be given to the physical number of AI Cores and operator types."

msgid "grid 优先使用 1D；2D NPU 适配写法也会合并为 1D，例如 `(20,)` 与 `(4, 5)` 的效果相同。"
msgstr "grid prefers 1D; 2D NPU-compatible writing will also be merged into 1D, for example, `(20,)` has the same effect as `(4, 5)`."

msgid "Vector-only 算子的并发任务数通常按 Vector Core 数量组织；包含 `tl.dot` 的算子通常按 AI Core 数量组织。"
msgstr "The number of concurrent tasks for Vector-only operators is typically organized based on the number of Vector Cores; operators that include `tl.dot` are usually organized based on the number of AI Cores."

msgid "当逻辑 grid 远大于物理核数时，需要评估是否改成每个 program 内部循环处理多个 tile，或在逻辑核之间无顺序依赖时使用 `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL`。"
msgstr "When the logical grid is much larger than the number of physical cores, it is necessary to evaluate whether to modify each program to handle multiple tiles in an internal loop, or to use `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL` when there is no sequential dependency between logical cores."

msgid "coreDim 不能超过 `UINT16_MAX`（65535），大 shape 算子需要结合 BLOCK_SIZE 或分块方式控制 grid 大小。"
msgstr "coreDim cannot exceed `UINT16_MAX` (65535). Large shape operators need to control the grid size by combining BLOCK_SIZE or a block-based approach."

msgid "维度"
msgstr "dimension"

msgid "核心结构"
msgstr "Core Structure"

msgid "算子类型"
msgstr "Operator Type"

msgid "昇腾 NPU (Ascend)"
msgstr "Ascend NPU"

msgid "多个 AI Core，分为 Cube Core（矩阵乘）和 Vector Core（向量计算）"
msgstr "Multiple AI Cores, divided into Cube Core (matrix multiplication) and Vector Core (vector computation)."

msgid "Vector-only 算子 → 并发任务数 = Vector Core 数；含 `tl.dot` 算子 → 并发任务数 = AI Core 数"
msgstr "Vector-only operator → number of concurrent tasks = number of Vector Cores; operator containing `tl.dot` → number of concurrent tasks = number of AI Cores"

msgid "GPU NVIDIA/AMD"
msgstr "NVIDIA/AMD GPU"

msgid "多个 CUDA Core（标量/向量计算） + Tensor Core（矩阵乘）"
msgstr "Multiple CUDA Cores (scalar/vector computation) + Tensor Cores (matrix multiplication)"

msgid "GPU 算子一般由编译器和硬件自动决定并发度"
msgstr "GPU operators generally have their concurrency automatically determined by the compiler and hardware."

msgid "检查单核数据搬运"
msgstr "Check single-core data transfer"

msgid "完成设备替换后，需要继续检查单个 program 内的数据搬运方式："
msgstr "After completing the device replacement, it is necessary to continue checking the data transfer method within a single program."

msgid "Vector 算子场景下要求 32 字节访存对齐，cube-vector 融合算子场景下要求 512 字节对齐。"
msgstr "In the Vector operator scenario, 32-byte memory access alignment is required, while in the cube-vector fusion operator scenario, 512-byte alignment is required."

msgid "保留 tail mask，确认边界元素不会越界访问。"
msgstr "Retain the tail mask to ensure that boundary elements do not cause out-of-bounds access."

msgid "检查一次 tile 的片上内存占用，避免触发 UB 空间溢出。"
msgstr "Check the on-chip memory usage of a tile to avoid triggering UB space overflow."

msgid "移除或替换 GPU 专属同步 API，例如 CUDA thread、stream、event 或 kernel synchronize 相关接口。"
msgstr "Remove or replace GPU-specific synchronization APIs, such as CUDA thread, stream, event, or kernel synchronize related interfaces."

msgid "检查单核数据运算"
msgstr "Check single-core data computation"

msgid "NPU 与 GPU 的计算单元和支持的数据类型存在差异。迁移后应先保证正确性，再根据性能问题调整："
msgstr "There are differences in the compute units and supported data types between NPUs and GPUs. After migration, correctness should be ensured first, and then adjustments should be made based on performance issues."

msgid "对整数索引、offset、长度等中间值，优先确认当前数据类型是否被 NPU 路径高效支持。"
msgstr "For intermediate values such as integer indices, offsets, and lengths, first confirm whether the current data type is efficiently supported by the NPU path."

msgid "对含 `tl.dot` 的算子，确认 M/N/K tile、累加 dtype 和输出 dtype 是否符合 NPU 后端要求。"
msgstr "For operators containing `tl.dot`, ensure that the M/N/K tile, accumulation dtype, and output dtype comply with the NPU backend requirements."

msgid "对长序列、长 hidden size 或大 K 维循环，优先通过 tiling 控制单次搬入和计算规模。"
msgstr "For long sequences, large hidden sizes, or high-dimensional K loops, prioritize controlling the single-load and computation scale through tiling."

msgid "迁移示例"
msgstr "Migration Example"

msgid "示例 1：向量加法完整迁移"
msgstr "Example 1: Complete Migration of Vector Addition"

msgid "示例 2：设备替换与单核数据搬运"
msgstr "Example 2: Device Replacement and Single-Core Data Transfer"

msgid "以下示例展示将设备从 CUDA 替换为 NPU 后，对单核数据搬运场景进行正确性验证："
msgstr "The following example demonstrates correctness verification for a single-core data transfer scenario after replacing the device from CUDA to NPU."

msgid "常见问题概览"
msgstr "Common Issues Overview"

msgid "完成迁移基础步骤后，可能会遇到新的问题，新问题可归纳为以下两类："
msgstr "After completing the basic migration steps, new issues may arise, which can be summarized into the following two categories:"

msgid "coreDim 限制问题"
msgstr "coreDim limitation issue"

msgid "当网格维度超过NPU硬件限制时触发。 典型错误信息：`coreDim=xxxx can't be greater than UINT16_MAX`。"
msgstr "Triggered when the grid dimension exceeds the NPU hardware limit. Typical error message: `coreDim=xxxx can't be greater than UINT16_MAX`."

msgid "UB 空间溢出"
msgstr "UB space overflow"

msgid "内存使用超出NPU缓存容量。 典型错误信息：`ub overflow, requires xxxx bits while 1572864 bits available!`。"
msgstr "Memory usage exceeds NPU cache capacity. Typical error message: `ub overflow, requires xxxx bits while 1572864 bits available!`."

msgid "解决 coreDim 超限问题"
msgstr "Resolving the coreDim out-of-bounds issue"

msgid "问题分析: NPU的 coreDim 参数不能超过 UINT16_MAX（65535）。当处理大规模数据时，简单的grid划分可能导致该限制被突破。"
msgstr "Problem Analysis: The `coreDim` parameter of the NPU cannot exceed UINT16_MAX (65535). When processing large-scale data, simple grid partitioning may cause this limit to be exceeded."

msgid "案例：zeros_like 函数优化 数据规模：N = 1073741824，原始 BLOCK_SIZE = 2048，计算得到的 coreDim = 524288 > 65535（超限）"
msgstr "Case: zeros_like function optimization Data size: N = 1073741824, original BLOCK_SIZE = 2048, calculated coreDim = 524288 > 65535 (exceeds limit)"

msgid "解决思路1： 昇腾编译器针对coreDim超限问题，有对应的解决方案，只需将环境变量'TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL'设为1。设置命令如下："
msgstr "Solution 1: The Ascend compiler provides a corresponding solution for the coreDim overflow issue. Simply set the environment variable `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL` to 1. The command to set it is as follows:"

msgid "解决思路2： 通过增大 BLOCK_SIZE 来减少所需的核心数量，确保 coreDim 不超过限制。 计算公式如下："
msgstr "Solution 2: Increase BLOCK_SIZE to reduce the number of required cores, ensuring that coreDim does not exceed the limit. The calculation formula is as follows:"

msgid "代入 `N = 1073741824` 可得："
msgstr "Substituting `N = 1073741824` yields:"

msgid "因此，如果 `BLOCK_SIZE` 按 2 的幂取值，至少应设置为 `32768`。"
msgstr "Therefore, if `BLOCK_SIZE` is taken as a power of 2, it should be set to at least `32768`."

msgid "优化前的代码："
msgstr "Code before optimization:"

msgid "优化后的代码："
msgstr "Optimized code:"

msgid "动态计算适合的 BLOCK_SIZE 以避免 coreDim 超限"
msgstr "Dynamically compute the appropriate BLOCK_SIZE to avoid exceeding the coreDim limit."

msgid "处理复合问题：coreDim + UB 溢出"
msgstr "Handling composite issues: coreDim + UB overflow"

msgid "问题分析: 在某些情况下，解决了 coreDim 问题后可能引发新的UB溢出问题。这通常发生在增大 BLOCK_SIZE 后，单个线程块需要处理的数据量超出了NPU的UB缓存容量。"
msgstr "Problem Analysis: In some cases, resolving the coreDim issue may lead to new UB overflow problems. This typically occurs when increasing BLOCK_SIZE causes the amount of data a single thread block needs to process to exceed the NPU's UB cache capacity."

msgid "案例： 数据规模：N = 1073741824，原始 BLOCK_SIZE = 4096，计算得到的 coreDim = 262144 > 65535（超限），调整为 BLOCK_SIZE = 32768 后，coreDim = 32768（合规），但出现 UB 溢出"
msgstr "Case: Data size: N = 1073741824, original BLOCK_SIZE = 4096, calculated coreDim = 262144 > 65535 (exceeds limit). After adjusting BLOCK_SIZE = 32768, coreDim = 32768 (compliant), but UB overflow occurs."

msgid "解决思路： 引入 BLOCK_SIZE_SUB 参数，将大块进一步细分，在保持合理 coreDim 的同时控制内存使用。 优化前代码："
msgstr "Solution: Introduce the BLOCK_SIZE_SUB parameter to further subdivide large blocks, controlling memory usage while maintaining a reasonable coreDim. Code before optimization:"

msgid "优化后代码："
msgstr "Optimized code:"

msgid "为什么会出现UBSIZE超出内存的错误"
msgstr "Why does the UBSIZE out-of-memory error occur?"

msgid "切分不合理,存在过多的非对齐访存或者运算，例如对（64，32）二维数据搬运，对应stride(12832，128),如果是对齐数据的访存，对应的stride(32,1)。 对于非对齐访问内容，在最内轴新增一个大小为1的轴，变为（64，32，4） 由于硬件要求vector算子场景ub内存32bytes对齐 ，假设type=float16，对应stride应该为(12832, 128,1)"
msgstr "Unreasonable segmentation results in excessive unaligned memory access or computation. For example, when moving (64, 32) two-dimensional data, the corresponding stride is (12832, 128). For aligned data access, the corresponding stride is (32, 1). For unaligned access content, add a new axis of size 1 on the innermost axis, changing it to (64, 32, 4). Since the hardware requires 32-byte alignment for UB memory in vector operator scenarios, assuming type=float16, the corresponding stride should be (12832, 128, 1)."

msgid "离散访存代码逐行对比观察scalar低效映射"
msgstr "Discrete memory access code line-by-line comparison observes scalar inefficient mapping"

msgid "设置环境变量TRITON_DEBUG=1, 保存~/.triton/cache/xxx.ttadapter，然后执行"
msgstr "Set the environment variable `TRITON_DEBUG=1`, save `~/.triton/cache/xxx.ttadapter`, and then execute."

msgid "会有输出IR ， 对比Triton 算子逻辑与IR内部的操作，观察是否有未映射成指令的操作。 观察HIVM IR阶段是否存在纯scalar搬运或者计算， 没有映射为simd指令，这会成为性能瓶颈。"
msgstr "There will be an output IR. Compare the Triton operator logic with the operations inside the IR to observe whether there are any operations that have not been mapped to instructions. Observe whether there are pure scalar transfers or computations in the HIVM IR stage that have not been mapped to SIMD instructions, as this could become a performance bottleneck."

msgid "问题：离散访存 && scalar低效映射 b[1024, 32] = a[1024, 32]  Triton原先写法利用thread的方式 对[1024,32] 中的最低维度32绑定线程块, 再对1024切16，分为[64， 16， 32]，再对64绑定线程块"
msgstr "Problem: Disjoint memory access && scalar inefficient mapping b[1024, 32] = a[1024, 32]. The original Triton implementation uses threads to bind the lowest dimension 32 in [1024, 32] to thread blocks, then splits 1024 into 16, resulting in [64, 16, 32], and finally binds 64 to thread blocks."

msgid "优化思路"
msgstr "Optimization Approach"

msgid "调整 block_ptr 的 shape/stride: 把 (1024, 32) 看成二维矩阵，最低维度 32 是连续的，所以 stride 应该是 (32, 1)，而不是 (32,)，这样每个线程块能访问连续的 32 元素。让线程块绑定到行维度（1024），每个线程处理一整行的 32 元素。这样访存就是连续的，亲和性好。"
msgstr "Adjust the shape/stride of block_ptr: treat (1024, 32) as a two-dimensional matrix, where the lowest dimension 32 is contiguous, so the stride should be (32, 1) instead of (32,), allowing each thread block to access 32 contiguous elements. Bind the thread block to the row dimension (1024), with each thread processing an entire row of 32 elements. This ensures contiguous memory access and good locality."

